                 cursor on the focus:
 14EF   0006            '----- items get it at their lower-right, tabs/buttons 
                near their right edge
 14EF   0006            IF nvz = 0 THEN
 14EF   0006                    IF INT(isel / 4) < ivscr THEN ivscr = INT(isel 
                / 4)
 153E   0006                    IF INT(isel / 4) > ivscr + 1 THEN ivscr = INT(i
