 1D30   0024    
 1D30   0024    '----- derive cache slot acs's frame count. k frames interleave
                 word0 x k then
 1D30   0024    '----- height x k -- but when width*2 = height the leading-equa
                l count OVERSHOOTS
 1D30   0024    '----- (a 3x6 frame reads 6,6,6,6...). Validate candidates down
                ward: the k whose
