                 the raw count.
 1D30   0024    SUB AnimK (acPct%(), acN%(), acs, kk%)
 1D3B   0024            kk% = 1
 1D3B   0024            anf% = acN%(acs)
 1D3B   0024            IF anf% < 2 THEN EXIT SUB
 1D68   0024            ld% = 0
