 32F7   00B8    '----- OvReg: register a foreground overlay ("fg" anim mode) --
                 copy the frame
 32F7   00B8    '----- animframe just decoded (afrm/amfrm, anpf ints) into ovf(
                ) after the meta
 32F7   00B8    '----- header, so GAME5 OvTop can re-stamp it over the player (
